flowchart LR
    ui([Adviser UI]) --> quotes

    subgraph quotes [Quote service - this solution]
        qapi[Quotes API<br/>capture · status · history]
        qdb[(Quotes DB)]
        qob[Outbox]
        qapi --> qdb
        qapi --> qob
    end

    subgraph pricing [Pricing service - split out later]
        papi[Pricing API<br/>rate tables · versions]
    end

    qapi -->|IPricingService<br/>today in-process, later HTTP / gRPC| papi
    qob -->|quote-created.v1<br/>quote-status-changed.v1| bus([EventBridge / SNS])
    bus --> crm[CRM]
    bus --> notify[Client notifications]
    bus --> analytics[Analytics / conversion]
    qdb -. read replica / search index behind IQuoteReadService .-> reads[(Read model)]
